{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからさゆりんとPON!に生出演します(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキ緊張するけど、二人で頑張りますので是非見て下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/04/2826087/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、東北楽天ゴールデンイーグルスさん！日本一！\n初優勝おめでとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もテレビで見ていましたが、すごく熱い戦いで感動しました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと私たちも頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ？見ちゃいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋での姿が出てしまいました。\n収録の時は、もう明日から生きていけないと嘆いてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあの行動、メンバーも好きって言ってくれてみんなやってたりするんです、みんな可愛いんです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな姿をお見せしてしまいましたが、どうか見捨てないでください。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はちょっぴり恥ずかしさが残っていますが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ、なにやってんだわたし！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/04/2826087/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なら行ってくるんよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}